    "## 📥 Overview of Data Sources\n",
    "\n",
    "The following sources are processed:\n",
    "- **Falldauer**: Sick leave duration by time brackets (e.g. \"1–7 days\")\n",
    "- **Diagnosen**: Cases grouped by ICD-10 codes\n",
    "- **Diagnosen_grouped**: ICD codes grouped by main chapters (ICD letter)\n",
    "- **Alter**: Cases and days by age groups and ICD groups\n",
    "\n",
    "All files have been downloaded from `www.bundesgesundheitsministerium.de/themen/krankenversicherung/zahlen-und-fakten-zur-krankenversicherung/geschaeftsergebnisse.html`. <br>\n",
    "All files are stored in `DATA_DOWNLOAD`(see paths.py) and are processed annually.\n"
   ]
