    "## chapter 1.1: 📊 Importing \"Falldauer\" Data\n",
    "\n",
    "Each PDF file contains a table that reports the total number of cases and sick leave days by predefined duration brackets (e.g., 1–7 days, 8–14 days). \n",
    "\n",
    "Steps:\n",
    "1. Extract the year from the filename\n",
    "2. Identify the page range containing the relevant table\n",
    "3. Parse the table using a custom PDF parser (`extract_au_falldauer`)\n",
    "4. Calculate average duration per case (`Days_per_Case`)\n",
    "5. Append metadata (`Source`, `Year`)\n",
    "6. Save annual DataFrame as `.parquet`"
   ]
  },
